{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_0_0_welcome_to_guide","groupId":"main_0","stageId":null,"title":"序章·上","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/guide/beg/0_welcome_to_guide.txt","sourceHash":"81294ee8766c28ac9071f8df46469ee9bf0c47cfdca156d6f0154eb359b23cab","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"切尔诺伯格核心区，少女将棺中之人——博士唤醒。\n名为阿米娅的少女试图向博士解释现状，整合运动却在这时对他们发动了袭击。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"初始引导\n哦，是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_babel"},{"type":"narration","text":"离我们上一次见面，已经过去了很久。\n这段时间里......你一直徘徊在悬崖的边缘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你可能已经忘记了你的身份，但你还记得那个名字，这就够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——好了，别在这里逗留太久。\n毕竟，你既不是我的客人，也不应该出现在这里。\n她需要你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"12月23日。\n你可能记不清这一天对你来说，究竟意味着什么。\n这会让你陷入十分危险的处境。\n......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"不。\n你必须想起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_am"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......知觉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"开始循环............阻升主......停跳液注入完成......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......体温过低............海克塞米松20cc，静推。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"止血钳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......状态正常......开始切除......注意室颤......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又让你受苦了。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_0_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":".......手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抓......紧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧我的手！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_0_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"紧急......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......救......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......束了......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，博士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，博士他还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才，刚才博士......明明已经拉住我的手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是到现在，博士都没有清醒......怎么办......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！别那么着急，稍微冷静点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......抱，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"一遇到和博士有关的事情，你就变得慌慌张张的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，阿米娅，如果博士还是.....你该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——我做好心理准备了。就像我们之前说的那样做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。就按你说的做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那就......拜托你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧阿米娅，博士的状况已经稳定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我再检查一次好了，包在我身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那就......拜托你了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。呼吸比较微弱，血压正常。应该不要紧的。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，成功了，博士清醒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，太好了......博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，小心！你现在还不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"先别动，你的身体还没有完全适应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你们......是谁？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——博士——我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是来救你的。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......我是......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你和我们一样，也是“罗德岛”组织的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我的同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你是我，最重要的同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......不记得了吗？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......我真的能相信你吗？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。我知道这对于博士你来说很难接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有奢望你现在就能回忆起过去，也不会要求你现在就信任我。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说，Dr.{@nickname}也不记得我了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是这样......我也不会放弃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们为了找到你，已经付出了很多很多......"}]},{"label":"是吗......初次见面，阿米娅。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你，你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不是......我不知道该怎么说......很多事情都不再是以前那样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就连我，肯定也变得和过去不一样......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，对我来说，博士始终是我最重要的人。无论发生什么事，这一点是不会改变的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，请你.....请你多给我一点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只是一小段时间......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"博士真的......失忆了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，如果，这样能给博士一点空间的话......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这里到底是......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这里——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"诶？发生了什————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"全副武装的男性","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，有情况！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"全副武装的男性","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"有人闯进了设施！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"全副武装的男性","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的打扮......不是乌萨斯士兵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"——————"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"全副武装的男性","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想干什么！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"全副武装的男性","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"敌袭！阿米娅，敌人装备了重火力兵器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大家注意！利用掩体，保护好博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这打扮难道是......整合运动？怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫人员......做好战斗准备！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，这些家伙是冲着博士来的吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不......博士的存在不会有别人知道才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生的远程通讯呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道为什么，设备停止工作了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......有什么切断了我们之间的通讯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯政府发现了我们的行踪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"现在要怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"原本负责这次行动的凯尔希医生，现在没办法参与指挥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"————Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"————我希望，由博士来指挥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这......会不会太冒险了，博士才刚刚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想......试一试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然失去了记忆，但博士确实曾与我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......一同战斗过。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你教会了我这么多......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起经历了许多许多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的......博士你能为我们带来胜利。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你能为我们带来胜利。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白这样突然请求你很失礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，但是......拜托了，请你助我们一臂之力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也会辅助你的！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那就先打退他们！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们只能反击了，是吗？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我也不想再把博士你卷入这些纷争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在的我们，非常需要Dr.{@nickname}的智慧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"希望博士能在战斗中，把过去的感觉找回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"————也许连你自己都可能还不太相信......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是我相信你。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_0_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——我相信你，一定可以的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请指挥————罗德岛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["？？？","阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["全副武装的男性","近卫干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]}]}
